Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.45,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur0.8\fad(984,0)\bord2\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(942,984,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,710)}Cape Promise
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.45,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur0.8\fad(984,0)\c&HE6E7E8&\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(720,710)}Cape Promise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.31,0:02:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old man just killed a\Ngreat king squid with one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he trying to save us,\Nor is he just fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:02:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got cannons back here! You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try it and someone's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up there, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old bastard's mocking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a couple things we need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.59,0:03:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only polite to\Nintroduce yourself before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asking a question of\Nsomeone you've just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:04:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my name is Crocus, and I'm the\Nlighthouse keeper of the Twin Capes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm 71 and a half years old, Gemini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd like to know where we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your rude behavior leaves me\Ndisinclined to accommodate your curiosity?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,except that you are trespassing\Non my private resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I think it's pretty obvious,\Nseeing as how you were eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we\Nwere swallowed by the whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.45,0:04:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since when does a whale's\Nstomach have clouds in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, if we've been eaten,\Nwhat's going to happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.31,0:04:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be digested!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever heard of a running gag?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a gag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exit is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, even if I believed a whale's\Nbelly could have an exit door?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.45,0:04:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's there but sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No Scales. Nothing's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're painted on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant mural inside\Nthe whale's stomach. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it a doctor's playful mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making any\Nsense, you crazy old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, don't let him get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.63,0:05:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, if that is an exit,\Nthen we need to get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.51,0:05:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Crater, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no island! It's some kind of ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's made of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we're floating\Non a sea of gastric acid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a wooden ship wouldn't fare\Nwell if it stayed here too long Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's with this freaky whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's very angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aftershocks are a result of him\Nhitting his head against the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why he had such deep\Nscars on his forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all this strange howling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because he's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all starting to make sense\Nso what's the geezer up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than likely he's trying to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whale from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a despicable way to kill something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay we've Solved the\Nmystery of the whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how about we find a way out\Nof its belly before it digests us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no right to judge the old\Nman nor do we need to save the whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we need to do is Focus on\Nhow to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:06:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get anywhere if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Waves keep searching like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only Choice is to paddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.27,0:07:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught a glimpse of him\Nflying out of the whale's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old guy just jumped in! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The acid will eat him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so dizzy, I'm gonna hurl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whale's got a river inside it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are looking up, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been successful so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.23,0:08:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(478,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(436,478,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}Miss Wednesday\NMysterious Woman
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.23,0:08:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(478,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Miss Wednesday\NMysterious Woman
Dialogue: 3,0:08:02.23,0:08:04.65,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(478,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Miss Wednesday\NMysterious Woman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind these doors lie the beast's stomach,\Nand that troublesome geezer as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be eliminated before\Nhe can interfere again.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.04,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(476,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}Mr. 9\NMysterious Man
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.04,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Mr. 9\NMysterious Man
Dialogue: 3,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.04,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,640)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(476,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Mr. 9\NMysterious Man
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, it's all for the\Nwhale. Indeed, Mr. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whale's a precious creature,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and one that holds the sweet\Npromise of life for our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocus just resurfaced!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, forget about the old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our focus should be on finding\Na way to open these doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the plan, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, then we\Nkick through the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Mr. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that voice, Mr. Nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.37,0:08:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to fall into gastric acid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.39,0:09:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Luffy's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you suppose those\Ntwo weirdos are with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that old geezer disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop it, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't afford to beat\Nyourself up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only a tiny\Namount of sedative left,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and until I can make some\Nmore, you'll have to make nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you before, that wall\Ndivides the world's oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how\Nmany times you hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't break, not even for\Nsomeone as mighty as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't claim to speak whale, but\Nit seems to have calmed down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we saved your lives for the time being,\Nbut you better talk and make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine, these heathens are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.45,0:10:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's painfully\Nobvious, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we speak to their humanity and\Ncompassion, they should understand our plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You parasites are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I grow weary of this,\Nand for the last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as long as I draw breath, you will not\Nlay a single harmful finger on Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the old guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't bully us into\Nabandoning our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were sent here to hunt this whale, and\Nthat's exactly what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time we won't let you interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to give this\Nwhale a new blowhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He jumped straight into the\Nline of fire! Did he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he protecting the whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your defiance is pointless. Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waste your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake, that hulking\Nbeast will provide food for our town!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.59,0:11:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wanted to hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.77,0:11:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thank you for saving my life,\Nthough I must ask, why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.81,0:11:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was just something\Nabout those two I didn't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think it's time\Nwe got some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.43,0:12:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how did you end up inside this whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two are thugs from a nearby\Ntown looking for whale meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they caught him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.55,0:12:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon could feed the townspeople\Nfor at least two or three years easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they're concerned with is\Nfilling their fat, greedy bellies
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the whale's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a unique and magnificent creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An island whale, one of the\Nlargest species in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can only be found in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow them to\Nslaughter him for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that he's stuck\Nhere so far away from his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, there's a reason he keeps\Nhitting himself on the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And howling at Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to put it one way. Inside Laboon's\Nbody beats the heart of a human. He has
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most impatiently awaited And is eternally\Ndevoted to a certain band of pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going on 50 long years now Listen closely
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will reveal to you\NLaboon's tragic story
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.01,0:13:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One fine sunny day, while I was fulfilling\Nmy duties as the lighthouse keeper, some
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good-natured pirates came down Reverse\NMountain They were followed by a baby whale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spry and Chipper Whom I would soon\Ncome to know as the one and only Laboon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is an island whale,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the largest in the world They are a\Nrare species found only in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon had developed a\Nbond with the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.09,0:13:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traveling with them for\Nmuch of their journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But knowing the dangers of the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pirates chose to leave\NLaboon behind in the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the stubborn little\Nwhale followed them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a general rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,island whales are social animals and\Ntravel together in family groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspect that Laboon had somehow come to\Nfeel that those pirates were his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wear and tear on the\Npirate's ship was quite severe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they stayed here for several months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that time, I, too, was able to\Nforge a close relationship with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, when the day of their\Ndeparture finally arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.39,0:14:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask\Nof you, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you look after\NLaboon for a few years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my men and I have completed our\Nvoyage around the world, we'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're taking our ship to\Nthe end of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we return, I need you to\Nwait for us here with Crocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous, even\Nfor a mighty whale like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Three years\Nwill pass by like a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, no matter the\Ndistance, our friendship lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.07,0:15:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.47,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're setting sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoist the anchor! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to wait for us here\Nand mine Crocus, Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll be back! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was 50 long years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,50 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Laboon has been waiting all this\Ntime for his friends to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder he's upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of wait would\Ndrive anyone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is some canal. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing this whale's still alive\Nwith a hole like this in his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're responsible for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a doctor's playful\Nmind. Doctor? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.83,0:16:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legally certified.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also ran a clinic on\Nthe Cape once upon a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that, I served as a ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great! Then join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer have that kind of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploring the seas is a young man's bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a doctor hollows\Nout the inside of a whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's part of the treatment\Nthe girl is right with a creature of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this size It's virtually impossible to\Ntreat it from the outside therefore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devised a more drastic solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think 50 years is a bit extreme?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates sure know how\Nto test someone's patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.43,0:17:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That whale can wait forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you all being so pessimistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know that they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could still come back for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, have some sympathy, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was very touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, a whale still believing a promise\Nhis friends made despite all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a true bond, right, Pops? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the lesson here is\Nthat reality is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon's cohorts aren't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is they abandoned their quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned that they turned\Ntail and left the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, why abandon him like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say they ran away from the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:18:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if they made it\Nthrough the Calm Belt alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't claim to know\Nexactly what became of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I doubt they'll ever\Ncome back here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seasons, weather,\Ncurrents, wind direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.91,0:18:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the Grand Line, these elements\Nseem to defy the very laws of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Common sense is useless, and the terror\Nof that fact can be quite overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.87,0:18:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I've got this straight,\Nwhat you're saying is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These pirates were a bunch of cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cared more about\Nsaving their own asses?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than keeping a promise to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone abandon\Nsuch a loyal creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cruelty on a grand scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you've known all this,\Nwhy haven't you told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon can obviously communicate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems to understand humans\Nquite well for a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did tell him, down to\Nthe last miserable detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this isn't what you want\Nto hear, but it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends left the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bond you shared with\Neach other was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as real as the promise they\Nmade to return for you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, face the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those men are never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon, please, I say\Nthis for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.37,0:19:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that you\Ndon't want to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you need to realize\Nthat this is how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the day that Laboon\Nbegan to howl at Reverse Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon after he started slamming\Nhis body against the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if he believes that wall\Nis what keeps his friends away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by breaking it, he can\Nclear the path for their return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire his dedication.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never gave up on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He refuses to believe me because then\Nhe'd have to admit that it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that terrifies him more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way for him to\Ngo back to the West Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what we have is a paradox\Nof tragic proportions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.37,0:20:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laboon is a lost soul dying\Nto live with his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.13,0:20:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But won't stop killing\Nhimself to reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, for all the grief those\Npirates put him through,?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they did the same to you by\Nsaddling you with their burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.55,0:20:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you've done enough\Nfor Laboon. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.93,0:21:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scars on his hide are deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those in his heart are even deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.21,0:21:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs someone to tend his\Nwounds, and I'm all he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For years, he's battered himself\Nwhile I've patched him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strange friendship, but it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that idiot up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta watch him every second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.35,0:21:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been watching\Nhim, look what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flowing Rage Lens!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he's aware that that's our mast?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's on top of a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, stop tearing up the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boy! He's dead! Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take way more\Nthan that to kill Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to let us in on your\Nplan before you kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger than I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.91,0:22:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always tell when\Nsomeone's itching to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.97,0:22:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you want a battle,\NI'll gladly give you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your shipmates used to\Nspar with you, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.45,0:22:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.41,0:22:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can rival anything\Nthey threw at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell you what,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.79,0:22:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after me and my friends travel the Grand\NLine, we'll come back here and find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.51,0:22:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you better be\Nready for a rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.07,0:23:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.67,0:23:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this a symbol of my\Npromise to come do battle with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.97,0:23:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's a rush paint job,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.09,0:23:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you'll have to be careful\Nand avoid hitting your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or you'll rub it off, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.09,0:23:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodwill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.63,0:23:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are who?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean those two weirdos?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.73,0:23:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have happened when we\Nwere distracted by Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Wednesday, what\Nare we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, put some distance between us and\Nthese morons, then we report to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our time for completing this\Nmission has long since run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.87,0:23:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the others now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.39,0:23:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably already\Ncalling us traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but without our weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.67,0:24:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've no choice but to go back\Nto the office and start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this time, no one will stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.47,0:24:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I couldn't have! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.97,0:24:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's... gone. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.53,0:24:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you have lost the log? Pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.35,0:24:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.43,0:24:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have dropped it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're not going anywhere without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't. It won't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.73,0:24:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Unluckies!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.25,0:24:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're out of time! Mr.\NThirteen! It's Friday!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:37.35,0:24:41.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\an5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4\fad(477,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(435,477,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy80\fscx80\pos(1140,580)}Mr. 13\N\NMysterious\NSea Otter
