Dialogue: 2,0:24:37.35,0:24:41.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(477,0)\4a&HFF&\an5\fscy80\fscx80\pos(360,580)}Miss Friday\N\NMysterious\NVulture
Dialogue: 3,0:24:37.35,0:24:41.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(477,0)\4a&HFF&\an5\fscy80\fscx80\pos(360,580)}Miss Friday\N\NMysterious\NVulture
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.25,0:24:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.63,0:24:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, we can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.93,0:24:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll check in with Buzz immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.27,0:25:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.18,0:25:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally have some\Npeace and quiet so I can
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work on a plan for the Grand Line journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.11,0:25:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I forgot about\Nyou, elephant bluefin tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, that's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.05,0:25:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he breaks it, then\NI put it back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get off your lazy\Nbutt and give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.49,0:25:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship isn't going\Nto fix itself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.01,0:25:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind? Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.93,0:25:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some problem, my dearest Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.91,0:25:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's food you're\Nworried about, say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone say food?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.93,0:25:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The compass is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.51,0:25:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The needle just spins.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.93,0:25:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.84,0:25:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.99,0:25:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you,\Nbut I'm getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.19,0:25:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is sadly apparent that\Nnone of you possess the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.17,0:25:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slightest knowledge about\Nhow things work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.77,0:25:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you all come here to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.73,0:25:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.65,0:25:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.65,0:25:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing wrong with your compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line has little\Nregard for the rules of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.63,0:26:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Common sense is useless in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.09,0:26:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we are surrounded by\Na powerful magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.49,0:26:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The islands here are riddled\Nwith magnetic minerals,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.57,0:26:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which cause all sorts of abnormalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.85,0:26:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, the winds and currents\Nlack constancy in their patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.49,0:26:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a navigator, I'm sure you\Ncan appreciate this dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.13,0:26:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then, if we don't have a way to tell\Ndirection, this whole trip is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.37,0:26:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say. We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.33,0:26:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the navigator,\Nso navigate us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.03,0:26:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.21,0:26:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ought to try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all of you just shut up for five\Nseconds so I can figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.49,0:26:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This noise of the elephant tuna\Nis my favorite part, tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have any hope of\Nnavigating the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.81,0:26:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to need a\NLog Pose to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.87,0:26:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Log Pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.19,0:26:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a specially designed compass\Nthat can record levels of magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.17,0:26:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it strange looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.63,0:26:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, yes, it does have an odd shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.15,0:27:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.61,0:27:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.13,0:27:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a fool courting disaster would attempt\Nto travel the Grand Line without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.39,0:27:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.81,0:27:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.19,0:27:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you\Nhad one of those log things?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.97,0:27:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it on deck just laying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.63,0:27:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two weirdos must have\Ndropped it when they escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.21,0:27:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you hit me? It felt right. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.59,0:27:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, but there isn't a\Ndial face on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.39,0:27:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.57,0:27:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a special brand of magnetism that\Nruns through the Grand Line Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.41,0:27:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complete with its own set of rules\Nthat makes it possible to get around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.67,0:27:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By recording the level of\Nmagnetism between two islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.87,0:27:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can chart a route from\None island to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.17,0:27:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Log Pose method is\Nreally the only choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.17,0:27:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since the magnetism here presents huge\Nproblems for conventional navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.73,0:27:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, Reverse Mountain\Nis a great starting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.15,0:28:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It produces seven levels of magnetism,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.21,0:28:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't matter which\None you choose to start with.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.11,0:28:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually, all of them will pull\Nagainst each other and form one route.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.03,0:28:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the island at the end\Nof that route is Raftel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.17,0:28:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last and most mysterious\Nin the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.25,0:28:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its very existence was confirmed\Nby the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.81,0:28:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only known person to have traveled\Nthe Grand Line in its entirety.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.35,0:28:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raftel. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.13,0:28:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be where the\NOne Piece is hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.97,0:28:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the most prominent theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.97,0:28:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no one's been able to set\Nfoot on Raftel Island since.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.67,0:28:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll know soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.25,0:28:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you that was for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.41,0:28:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even ate the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.33,0:28:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Log Pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.35,0:28:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to take special care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.15,0:28:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the key to finding the\Ngreatest treasure of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.87,0:28:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You greedy, bottomless pit, you\Nate the meal I made for Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.03,0:28:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you left\Nroom for your dessert!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's everyone hitting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.39,0:29:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never think of anyone\Nbut yourself and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.30,0:29:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.29,0:29:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, get out of my\Nsight before I wring your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.23,0:29:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.99,0:29:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,correct me if I'm wrong, but doesn't the\NLog Pose work better when it's not broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.75,0:29:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.66,0:29:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Log Pose is ruined. Calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.35,0:29:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will give you my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a thank you for helping Laboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.61,0:29:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.91,0:29:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, dear lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to help you to your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.33,0:29:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice day, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.91,0:30:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.17,0:30:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whiskey Peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.59,0:30:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's a funny name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.19,0:30:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where we live, um, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.77,0:30:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you stranded?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.07,0:30:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.23,0:30:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asking us for a ride is pushing it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.33,0:30:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine, especially after\Nyou try to kill the whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.45,0:30:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.63,0:30:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.39,0:30:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying! No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.71,0:30:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't say! She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.65,0:30:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.87,0:30:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only motive here is getting home!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.41,0:30:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd tell you everything if\Nwe could, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mystery is our company's motto!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.25,0:30:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, we have to be\Nmysterious, it's sort of a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.79,0:30:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have confidence in your character.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.79,0:30:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you give us the same courtesy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.55,0:30:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, we're begging you,\Nshow some mercy. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two fools are dishonest to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.73,0:30:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.07,0:30:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.98,0:30:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should mention that our Log Pose was\Nbroken and we don't have another one,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.03,0:30:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so still want to ride with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.55,0:30:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? You broke it? That was mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.77,0:30:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those aren't cheap, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.89,0:31:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stuck here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.93,0:31:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long were you going to make us\Nback before you bothered to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.45,0:31:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocus gave us his Log Pose, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.41,0:31:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please have pity on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.59,0:31:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lousy bitch, she tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.95,0:31:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, you can ride with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.57,0:31:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said your home is called Whiskey Peak?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.31,0:31:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two are obviously some\Npretty shady characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.31,0:31:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would we take them anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.85,0:31:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.77,0:31:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat the small stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.09,0:31:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.00,0:31:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose your route carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.59,0:31:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you head out from here,\Nyou'll be committed to that course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.66,0:31:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't like it, we'll try\Na different route next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.45,0:31:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.87,0:31:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time we get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that me and Laboon have an understanding,\NI can leave with a clear conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.39,0:31:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who on earth do you\Nthink you are, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.35,0:31:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.25,0:31:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, i'm the man who'll\Nbe king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.21,0:31:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too bright, this one
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.35,0:32:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be good to go The Log Pose\Nhas had plenty of time to store the
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.55,0:32:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,route The needle should be pointing\Nin the same direction as the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.53,0:32:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointing directly to Whisky Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.01,0:32:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.11,0:32:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for the lock pose!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.87,0:32:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.78,0:32:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.35,0:32:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm off, Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.49,0:32:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready to fight when I get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.89,0:32:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, Whiskey Peak!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.25,0:32:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.89,0:32:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.25,0:32:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and his exuberant crew could be\Nthe very pirates we've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.73,0:32:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That young captain sure\Nhas a way about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.67,0:32:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's uncanny, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.31,0:33:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.91,0:33:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got me, heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.69,0:33:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wrote you a love song\Nto let you know that I.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.13,0:33:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna be with you till the end of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.57,0:33:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when the sparkles fade!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.11,0:33:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And doubts invade our\None still trusting light?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.21,0:33:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you that I will stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.79,0:33:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find a way to look\Nthrough the cloudy skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.69,0:33:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We built a castle of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.15,0:33:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we're watching it wash away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.85,0:33:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to end!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll start again, this time round.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.83,0:33:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll build a stronger love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.89,0:34:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got me heart and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.71,0:34:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanna hold you and not let go.
